$f=0$ on $b<|x|<b+\delta$.
Choose radii $r_1,r_2,r_3$ such that 
$a<r_1<b<b+\delta<r_2<r_3$.
Take a cutoff function $\chi\in C_c^\infty(\mathbb R^d\setminus\{0\})$ 
